    "_human_only_note": "Signature fields, date-of-signature fields, and the per-page PDF417 barcodes are never filled by Ellis. Out-of-scope supplements (Trade Agreement, O/P, Q, R) carry further signature fields under P5_Line6a_SignatureofApplicant[1..6]; none of their sections are mapped."
